00:01:16.060 --> 00:01:17.754
FRANCESC CAMPOY: Yeah.

00:01:17.754 --> 00:01:19.920
Which is pretty cool, because
actually the answer is

00:01:19.920 --> 00:01:21.790
related to something new, too.

00:01:21.790 --> 00:01:25.360
So, a very interesting
question and answer.

00:01:25.360 --> 00:01:28.230
But before that, we have
the cool things of the week.

00:01:28.230 --> 00:01:30.190
The first cool
things of the week.

00:01:30.190 --> 00:01:32.730
And we had to choose
only three out

00:01:32.730 --> 00:01:34.860
